{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24674","headline":"酬寄牛相公同宿话旧劝酒见赠 · 白居易","name":"酬寄牛相公同宿话旧劝酒见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"每来政事堂中宿，共忆华阳观里时。\n日暮独归愁米尽，泥深同出借驴骑。\n交游今日唯残我，富贵当年更有谁。\n彼此相看头雪白，一杯可合重推辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24674.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24674","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}